   "style": "d7d35afb",
   "content": "bf41e879",
   "text": "写入 00-Prerequisites/regularization/README.md，完整内"
  },
  {
   "slot": 15,
   "kind": "code",
   "top": 824,
   "h": 1179,
   "style": "82d48a9a",
   "content": "a7414263",
   "text": "# 为什么模型会\"死记硬背\"？—— 正则化与 Dropout ## 这个问题从哪来 > 2012"
  },
  {
   "slot": 16,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 2003,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "16a0d80a",
   "content": "7d3fe198",
   "text": "过拟合的根源是模型容量 > 数据提供的信息量。参数越多、数据越少，模型越有\"余力\"去记忆噪声而非"
  },
  {
   "slot": 17,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 2076,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "e4907936",
   "content": "81115ed9",
   "text": "诊断方法很简单：画训练 loss 和验证 loss 的曲线。当两条线开始分叉——训练 loss "
  },
  {
   "slot": 18,
   "kind": "quote",
   "top": 2150,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "eef181d6",
   "content": "38cf41de",
   "text": "你要记住：正则化的本质不是\"让模型变差\"，而是\"限制有效容量\"，让模型把有限的容量花在学习规律而"
  },
  {
   "slot": 19,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 2223,
   "h": 42,
   "style": "71b6e53a",
   "content": "50e10e92",
   "text": "2.2 Dropout：核心机制§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 20,
   "kind": "mermaid",
   "top": 2265,
   "h": 522,
   "style": "dbf150b3",
   "content": "24f641e2",
   "text": "graph TD H[\"隐藏层输出 h\\n(batch, hidden)\"]:::input M"
  },
  {
   "slot": 21,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 2787,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "f54de366",
   "content": "6a19ce84",
   "text": "Inverted Dropout 的操作分三步："
  },
  {
   "slot": 22,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 2833,
   "h": 32,
   "style": "d98f5dbf",
   "content": "cbb32ef1",
   "text": "生成掩码：mi∼Bernoulli(1−p)m_i \\sim \\text{Bernoulli}("
  },
  {
   "slot": 23,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 2864,
   "h": 32,
   "style": "c5b7fc19",
   "content": "7a9fa581",
   "text": "逐元素相乘：h~i=mi⋅hi\\tilde{h}_i = m_i \\cdot h_ih~i​=m"
  },
  {
   "slot": 24,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 2896,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "0bd8a28b",
   "content": "b5b6d2da",
   "text": "缩放：h~i=mi⋅hi1−p\\tilde{h}_i = \\frac{m_i \\cdot h_i"
  },
  {
   "slot": 25,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 2942,
   "h": 76,
   "style": "c1a0121e",
   "content": "c80fab2a",
   "text": "为什么除以 (1−p)(1-p)(1−p)？ 这是 inverted dropout 的关键：在"
  },
  {
   "slot": 26,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 3018,
   "h": 102,
   "style": "55b85603",
   "content": "da51ed66",
   "text": "从贝叶斯视角看，Dropout 等价于对指数级多个子网络做**模型平均（model averag"
  },
  {
   "slot": 27,
   "kind": "quote",
   "top": 3119,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "f66c19cc",
   "content": "d46c82cb",
   "text": "你要记住：Dropout 推理时必须关闭——它不是在给网络加噪声，是在做模型平均的近似。忘记 m"
  },
  {
   "slot": 28,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 3193,
   "h": 42,
   "style": "71b6e53a",
   "content": "114691e1",
   "text": "2.3 权重衰减（L2 正则化）§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 29,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 3235,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "f54de366",
   "content": "9b0f2a37",
   "text": "在损失函数后加一个对参数大小的惩罚项："
  },
  {
   "slot": 30,
   "kind": "math",
   "top": 3280,
   "h": 99,
   "style": "f8b1db64",
   "content": "f11dc6a7",
   "text": "Lreg=L+λ2∥θ∥2L_{reg} = L + \\frac{\\lambda}{2}\\|\\t"
  },
  {
   "slot": 31,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 3379,
   "h": 47,
   "style": "88947f10",
   "content": "f4188227",
   "text": "梯度更新时多出一项 λθ\\lambda \\thetaλθ，效果是每次更新都把权重往零拉一点——这"
  },
  {
   "slot": 32,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 3426,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "7a1385df",
   "content": "83d9d9a7",
   "text": "与 Dropout 的对比："
  },
  {
   "slot": 33,
   "kind": "table",
   "top": 3471,
   "h": 234,
   "style": "84f89e88",
   "content": "7228337d",
   "text": "维度L2 正则化Dropout作用对象参数值的大小神经元的激活直觉不允许任何权重过大不允许任何神"
  },
  {
   "slot": 34,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 3705,
   "h": 131,
   "style": "f54a3993",
   "content": "b6194741",
   "text": "PyTorch 中 optimizer = torch.optim.AdamW(model.pa"
  },
  {
   "slot": 35,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 3836,
   "h": 42,
   "style": "71b6e53a",
   "content": "35151d62",
   "text": "2.4 变体演进§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 36,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 3878,
   "h": 44,
   "style": "2e3410ae",
   "content": "aa48c1bd",
   "text": "DropConnect（2013, Wan et al.）"
  },
  {
   "slot": 37,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 3921,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "08ac1d17",
   "content": "2d9a787d",
   "text": "不 drop 激活值，而是 drop 权重矩阵的元素。比 Dropout 更激进——每次前向传播"
  },
  {
   "slot": 38,
   "kind": "math",
   "top": 3995,
   "h": 84,
   "style": "467e06cf",
   "content": "3db0bc3f",
   "text": "W~=M⊙W\\tilde{W} = M \\odot WW~=M⊙W"
  },
  {
   "slot": 39,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4079,
   "h": 47,
   "style": "374ec3db",
   "content": "40862e2b",
   "text": "其中 MMM 是与 WWW 同形状的 Bernoulli 掩码。"
  },
  {
   "slot": 40,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4126,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "f54de366",
   "content": "5c0271fd",
   "text": "优势：更强的正则化效果。代价：实现更复杂，训练更慢，实际使用较少。"
  },
  {
   "slot": 41,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4171,
   "h": 44,
   "style": "233cdc22",
   "content": "34015de4",
   "text": "SpatialDropout（2014）"
  },
  {
   "slot": 42,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4215,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "e4907936",
   "content": "854164ee",
   "text": "标准 Dropout 对特征图的每个像素独立 drop，但 CNN 的特征图中相邻像素高度相关—"
  },
  {
   "slot": 43,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4289,
   "h": 75,
   "style": "11c53f2f",
   "content": "d9ff2f1c",
   "text": "SpatialDropout 直接 drop 整个 channel：以概率 ppp 把某个特征图"
  },
  {
   "slot": 44,
   "kind": "code",
   "top": 4363,
   "h": 99,
   "style": "560f34e0",
   "content": "4871d68f",
   "text": "# 标准 Dropout vs SpatialDropout nn.Dropout(p) # 每"
  },
  {
   "slot": 45,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4462,
   "h": 44,
   "style": "10a11c76",
   "content": "a4050c6f",
   "text": "DropBlock（2018, Ghose et al.）"
  },
  {
   "slot": 46,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4506,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "08d775c9",
   "content": "dd609757",
   "text": "SpatialDropout drop 整个 channel，但有时特征的相关性不在整个通道上，"
  },
  {
   "slot": 47,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4579,
   "h": 102,
   "style": "426cc068",
   "content": "3c56325d",
   "text": "DropBlock drop 的是连续的方形区域。参数 block_size 控制区域大小，是 "
  },
  {
   "slot": 48,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4681,
   "h": 44,
   "style": "ab7b3d0d",
   "content": "42b15946",
   "text": "Dropout in RNNs（2014, Zaremba et al.）"
  },
  {
   "slot": 49,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4724,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "5879f94c",
   "content": "a208c9f9",
   "text": "RNN 的循环连接是时间步之间传递信息的通道。如果在这里加 Dropout，每一步都可能丢掉关键"
  },
  {
   "slot": 50,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 4798,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "e7b039ae",
   "content": "0b7ce773",
   "text": "Zaremba 的方案：只在非循环连接上（层与层之间）加 Dropout，循环连接上不加。这样既"
  },
  {
   "slot": 51,
   "kind": "code",
   "top": 4872,
   "h": 99,
   "style": "7589ed17",
   "content": "ab157f05",
   "text": "# PyTorch 的 LSTM/GRU 内置了这个策略 nn.LSTM(input_size,"
  },
  {
   "slot": 52,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 4971,
   "h": 42,
   "style": "71b6e53a",
   "content": "9426357f",
   "text": "2.5 其他正则化手段（点到为止）§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 53,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 5012,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "23bdef8a",
   "content": "6ab19d9b",
   "text": "Early Stopping：验证集 loss 连续 N 个 epoch 不降就停止训练。N 称"
  },
  {
   "slot": 54,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 5086,
   "h": 102,
   "style": "cded8b32",
   "content": "41266925",
   "text": "Data Augmentation：对训练数据做随机变换（图像的裁剪、翻转、颜色抖动；文本的同义"
  },
  {
   "slot": 55,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 5188,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "2ab69122",
   "content": "1616bd57",
   "text": "Label Smoothing：把硬标签 [0, 1, 0] 软化为 [0.1, 0.8, 0."
  },
  {
   "slot": 56,
   "kind": "quote",
   "top": 5261,
   "h": 74,
   "style": "eef181d6",
   "content": "6ff67586",
   "text": "你要记住：正则化手段没有银弹，实际效果取决于数据、模型和任务的组合。最常见的组合是 Data A"
  },
  {
   "slot": 57,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 5335,
   "h": 42,
   "style": "71b6e53a",
   "content": "52205d92",
   "text": "2.6 渐进式实现§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 58,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 5377,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "cac977e3",
   "content": "42ce89db",
   "text": "Step 1 · 纯 NumPy 实现 inverted dropout（核心逻辑，可独立运行）"
  },
  {
   "slot": 59,
   "kind": "code",
   "top": 5422,
   "h": 339,
   "style": "e2527604",
   "content": "3c6bec51",
   "text": "# 实现 inverted dropout：训练时 mask+缩放，推理时直接通过 import"
  },
  {
   "slot": 60,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 5761,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "085dd3de",
   "content": "53d65c47",
   "text": "Step 2 · PyTorch nn.Dropout + train/eval 切换"
  },
  {
   "slot": 61,
   "kind": "code",
   "top": 5807,
   "h": 399,
   "style": "35b6664c",
   "content": "2ac6d587",
   "text": "# 对比手动实现和 PyTorch 内置，验证 train/eval 模式切换行为 import"
  },
  {
   "slot": 62,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 6206,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "774f4336",
   "content": "52c7db27",
   "text": "Step 3 · CNN 中 SpatialDropout 的使用"
  },
  {
   "slot": 63,
   "kind": "code",
   "top": 6251,
   "h": 359,
   "style": "f743ed30",
   "content": "14368300",
   "text": "# SpatialDropout drop 整个 channel，适配 CNN 特征图的空间相关"
  },
  {
   "slot": 64,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 6610,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "49a94f12",
   "content": "5f9600ce",
   "text": "Step 4 · 对比实验：不同 Dropout 率下的 train/val loss"
  },
  {
   "slot": 65,
   "kind": "code",
   "top": 6656,
   "h": 1199,
   "style": "efb455a7",
   "content": "4a312ae5",
   "text": "# 验证 Dropout 率对过拟合的影响 # 同一 MLP，仅改变 dropout rate，"
  },
  {
   "slot": 66,
   "kind": "rule",
   "top": 7855,
   "h": 19,
   "style": "e5aa0c45",
   "content": "811c9dc5",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "slot": 67,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 7874,
   "h": 65,
   "style": "a4cadef8",
   "content": "8b8c2f31",
   "text": "3. 工程陷阱§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 68,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 7939,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "f54de366",
   "content": "714276f8",
   "text": "优先级从高到低："
  },
  {
   "slot": 69,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 7984,
   "h": 66,
   "style": "a721abd2",
   "content": "6a641b39",
   "text": "Dropout rate 过高（> 0.5） → 浅层网络欠拟合，训练 loss 降不下去 处置"
  },
  {
   "slot": 70,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 8050,
   "h": 66,
   "style": "82765b9e",
   "content": "388a209e",
   "text": "忘记 model.eval() → 推理时 Dropout 仍然生效，每次预测结果不同 处置：推"
  },
  {
   "slot": 71,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 8116,
   "h": 66,
   "style": "75a44611",
   "content": "b24668eb",
   "text": "weight_decay + Adam 的互动 → 标准 Adam 中 weight_decay"
  },
  {
   "slot": 72,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 8182,
   "h": 94,
   "style": "09ce4086",
   "content": "e3be2c37",
   "text": "BatchNorm 和 Dropout 顺序不当 → Dropout 改变激活分布，BatchN"
  },
  {
   "slot": 73,
   "kind": "listItem",
   "top": 8275,
   "h": 75,
   "style": "59e30e3b",
   "content": "c09d65f2",
   "text": "RNN 中 Dropout 加错位置 → 在循环连接上加 Dropout 会破坏长程依赖 处置："
  },
  {
   "slot": 74,
   "kind": "rule",
   "top": 8351,
   "h": 19,
   "style": "e5aa0c45",
   "content": "811c9dc5",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "slot": 75,
   "kind": "heading",
   "top": 8369,
   "h": 65,
   "style": "a4cadef8",
   "content": "56edc2d1",
   "text": "演进笔记§"
  },
  {
   "slot": 76,
   "kind": "quote",
   "top": 8434,
   "h": 203,
   "style": "56b08e13",
   "content": "5846674b",
   "text": "正则化的遗产：从 2012 年 Dropout 开始，正则化手段从\"手动加噪声\"演变为\"自适应正"
  },
  {
   "slot": 77,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 8638,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "57ffa9e6",
   "content": "44086af3",
   "text": "→ 下一章：训练与优化 — 为什么加深网络之后训练反而变差了？"
  },
  {
   "slot": 78,
   "kind": "rule",
   "top": 8683,
   "h": 19,
   "style": "e5aa0c45",
   "content": "811c9dc5",
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "slot": 79,
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "top": 8702,
   "h": 46,
   "style": "99449aff",
   "content": "625bc5f5",
   "text": "上一章: 深度学习基础 | 下一章: 训练与优化"
  },
  {
   "slot": 80,
